abstract: >-
  Conceptual framework and engineering protocol for Codity — a measure of
  structural organization, semantic density and programmability of matter —
  including the Shannon-Mirror Lemma on the limits of cross-verification
  between derived material projections (common-mode errors require an
  external oracle).
